                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.8227/12: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Walton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-01-24T17:00:00-00:44">January 24, 1940—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 24—12:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4. Aviation agreement<anchor n="55" xml:id="d696-f1"/> effected by exchange of
                    notes in accordance with Department’s instruction No. 152, September 12,
                    1939.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Walton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
